.</p>
          <p>My academic journey has been defined by a relentless desire to=
 understand how intelligence=E2=80=94biological and artificial=E2=80=94emer=
ges from complex systems. I believe that the future of science lies at the =
intersection of these disciplines, and I am committed to contributing to th=
at frontier.</p>
          <p>From classrooms in Rajasthan to the Neural Computation Unit in=
 <strong>Okinawa, Japan</strong>, I am building the skills and experiences =
needed to make a meaningful impact on global neuroscience and AI research.<=
/p>
